{"info":{"name":"BMA-47 매칭 상태 조회 API (S5)","description":"S5 매칭 상태 조회 API 검증 컬렉션.\n\n두 계정을 만들어 관심사를 답하고 상호 좋아요로 매칭을 성사시킨 뒤, S5 카드가 필요로 하는 데이터(상대 마스킹 프로필·공통관심사·Reveal 진행 요약·채팅방 ID)와 매칭 없음/그만두기 흐름을 검증한다.\nRunner 로 위에서부터 순서대로 실행해야 한다(앞 요청이 만든 토큰·ID를 뒤에서 쓴다).\n\n사전 조건\n- docker compose up -d --build\n\n검증 항목: hasMatch 플래그, 마스킹(닉네임 null·시/도 지역명), 공통관심사 교집합, Reveal 요약, 인증 요구, 그만두기 후 빈 상태·상대 알림·멱등.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. 사용자 A 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// 매 실행마다 새 계정과 새 닉네임을 쓴다. 반복 실행해도 깨지지 않게 한다.","const t = Date.now();","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailA\", \"hub-a-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailB\", \"hub-b-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickA\", \"허브A\" + (t % 100000));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nickB\", \"허브B\" + (t % 100000));"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userA\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"2. 로그인 A","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"3. 프로필 A (서울 강남, M, ENFP)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"COMPLETE\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.profileStatus).to.eql(\"COMPLETE\"));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"nickname\":\"{{nickA}}\",\"birthDate\":\"1995-05-05\",\"genderCode\":\"M\",\"regionCode\":\"SEOUL_GANGNAM\",\"mbtiCode\":\"ENFP\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"4. 온보딩 질문 조회 - 관심사 문항·보기 ID 확보","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","const q = d.find(x => x.categoryCode === \"INTEREST\");","pm.test(\"INTEREST 문항 존재\", () => pm.expect(q).to.be.an(\"object\"));","const opt = code => q.options.find(o => o.optionCode === code).optionId;","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"qid\", q.questionId); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"optCulture\", opt(\"CULTURE\")); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"optTravel\", opt(\"TRAVEL\")); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"optFitness\", opt(\"FITNESS\"));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/questions","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","onboarding","questions"]}}},{"name":"5. A 관심사 답변: 문화생활 + 여행","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"savedCount=2\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.savedCount).to.eql(2));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"answers\":[{\"questionId\":{{qid}},\"optionId\":{{optCulture}},\"rank\":1},{\"questionId\":{{qid}},\"optionId\":{{optTravel}},\"rank\":2}]}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/answers","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","onboarding","answers"]}}},{"name":"6. 현재 매칭 조회 - 매칭 없음 (S5 빈 상태)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"hasMatch=false, match 키는 null 로 존재\", () => { pm.expect(d.hasMatch).to.eql(false); pm.expect(d).to.have.property(\"match\", null); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches/current","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches","current"]}}},{"name":"7. 매칭 목록 - 빈 배열","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"data=[]\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.eql([]));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches"]}}},{"name":"8. 사용자 B 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userB\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailB}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"9. 로그인 B","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenB\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailB}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"10. 프로필 B (서울 중구, F, INFP)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"nickname\":\"{{nickB}}\",\"birthDate\":\"1997-07-07\",\"genderCode\":\"F\",\"regionCode\":\"SEOUL_JUNG\",\"mbtiCode\":\"INFP\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"11. B 관심사 답변: 문화생활 + 운동","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"answers\":[{\"questionId\":{{qid}},\"optionId\":{{optCulture}},\"rank\":1},{\"questionId\":{{qid}},\"optionId\":{{optFitness}},\"rank\":2}]}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/answers","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","onboarding","answers"]}}},{"name":"12. A → B 좋아요 (한쪽만)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"matched=false\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.matched).to.eql(false));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"targetUserId\":{{userB}},\"actionType\":\"LIKE\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/actions","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","actions"]}}},{"name":"13. 여전히 매칭 없음","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"hasMatch=false\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.hasMatch).to.eql(false));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches/current","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches","current"]}}},{"name":"14. B → A 좋아요 → 상호 매칭 성사","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"matched=true, matchId·chatRoomId\", () => { pm.expect(d.matched).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.matchId).to.be.a(\"number\"); pm.expect(d.chatRoomId).to.be.a(\"number\"); });","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"matchId\", d.matchId); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"roomId\", d.chatRoomId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"targetUserId\":{{userA}},\"actionType\":\"LIKE\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/actions","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","actions"]}}},{"name":"15. A 현재 매칭 - S5 카드 데이터","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","const m = d.match;","pm.test(\"hasMatch=true, matchId/partnerUserId/chatRoomId 일치\", () => { pm.expect(d.hasMatch).to.eql(true); pm.expect(m.matchId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"matchId\")); pm.expect(m.partnerUserId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"userB\")); pm.expect(m.chatRoomId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"roomId\")); });","pm.test(\"partner: nickname null(???), 서울특별시, INFP, 20대, imageKeys []\", () => { pm.expect(m.partner).to.have.property(\"nickname\", null); pm.expect(m.partner.regionCode).to.eql(\"SEOUL\"); pm.expect(m.partner.regionName).to.eql(\"서울특별시\"); pm.expect(m.partner.mbtiCode).to.eql(\"INFP\"); pm.expect(m.partner.ageGroup).to.match(/^20대/); pm.expect(m.partner.imageKeys).to.eql([]); });","pm.test(\"commonInterests = [문화생활]\", () => pm.expect(m.commonInterests).to.eql([\"문화생활\"]));","pm.test(\"reveal: 0단계, 다음 1단계, 0/20, progressRate 0\", () => { pm.expect(m.reveal.currentLevel).to.eql(0); pm.expect(m.reveal.currentLevelName).to.eql(\"미공개\"); pm.expect(m.reveal.nextLevel).to.eql(1); pm.expect(m.reveal.messageCount).to.eql(0); pm.expect(m.reveal.requiredMessageCount).to.eql(20); pm.expect(m.reveal.progressRate).to.eql(0); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches/current","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches","current"]}}},{"name":"16. B 현재 매칭 - 상대는 A, 공통관심사 동일","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"partnerUserId=A, ENFP, [문화생활]\", () => { pm.expect(d.match.partnerUserId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"userA\")); pm.expect(d.match.partner.mbtiCode).to.eql(\"ENFP\"); pm.expect(d.match.commonInterests).to.eql([\"문화생활\"]); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches/current","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches","current"]}}},{"name":"17. A 매칭 목록 - 1건, 같은 모양","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"1건, partner·reveal 포함\", () => { pm.expect(d).to.have.lengthOf(1); pm.expect(d[0].matchId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"matchId\")); pm.expect(d[0].partner).to.be.an(\"object\"); pm.expect(d[0].reveal).to.be.an(\"object\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches"]}}},{"name":"18. 인증 없이 현재 매칭 (401)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches/current","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches","current"]}}},{"name":"19. 없는 매칭 ID 로 그만두기 (404)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 404 MATCH_003\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(404); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"MATCH_003\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches/999999999","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches","999999999"]}}},{"name":"20. B 매칭 그만두기 (S5-16)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches/{{matchId}}","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches","{{matchId}}"]}}},{"name":"21. A 현재 매칭 - 빈 상태로 전환","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"hasMatch=false\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.hasMatch).to.eql(false));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches/current","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches","current"]}}},{"name":"22. A 알림 - 종료 알림 (사유·주체 없음)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const items = pm.response.json().data.content;","pm.test(\"\\\"매칭이 종료되었어요\\\" 1건, 상대 닉네임 미포함\", () => { const ended = items.filter(n => n.title === \"매칭이 종료되었어요\"); pm.expect(ended).to.have.lengthOf(1); pm.expect(JSON.stringify(ended)).to.not.include(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"nickB\")); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?page=0&size=20","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","notifications"],"query":[{"key":"page","value":"0"},{"key":"size","value":"20"}]}}},{"name":"23. B 같은 매칭 다시 그만두기 - 멱등","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"DELETE","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches/{{matchId}}","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches","{{matchId}}"]}}},{"name":"24. A 알림 - 종료 알림 여전히 1건","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"중복 알림 없음\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.content.filter(n => n.title === \"매칭이 종료되었어요\")).to.have.lengthOf(1));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?page=0&size=20","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","notifications"],"query":[{"key":"page","value":"0"},{"key":"size","value":"20"}]}}},{"name":"25. B 매칭 목록 - 빈 배열","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"data=[]\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.eql([]));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenB}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matches","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matches"]}}}],"variable":[{"key":"baseUrl","value":"http://localhost:8080"},{"key":"password","value":"Passw0rd!23"},{"key":"emailA","value":""},{"key":"emailB","value":""},{"key":"nickA","value":""},{"key":"nickB","value":""},{"key":"tokenA","value":""},{"key":"tokenB","value":""},{"key":"userA","value":""},{"key":"userB","value":""},{"key":"qid","value":""},{"key":"optCulture","value":""},{"key":"optTravel","value":""},{"key":"optFitness","value":""},{"key":"matchId","value":""},{"key":"roomId","value":""}]}
